    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29492" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mŏlŏchĭnārĭus</span></b> 
			(<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">moloci-</span></b> ),
		ii, m.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A mallow-dyer, one who dyes with the color of
				mallows</i> (ante- and post-class.), <i><span class="en">Plaut. Aul.
				3, 5, 40</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A seller of mallowcolored garments</i>, Inscr. Mar.
			939, 6.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
